<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Macro for fastest editing on F, 2-3 times faster than normal. Bind macro to F and you will edit... literally crazy
Set the editing bind to F (In the game too)
if you are having issues, please contact me or another script/macro creators.
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 9 1
Delay 0 min
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 0 min
LeftDown 1
Delay 0 min
LeftUp 1
Delay 0 min
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 0 min
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 0 min</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fortnite</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
